      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 29.46,
      "text": "You're could open into motion, pedals lifting frame by frame."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.46,
      "end": 39.46,
      "text": "Not a flower, not a window, something tender without a name."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.96,
      "end": 68.46,
      "text": "Like I did in the upper chamber, folded faces through the steam."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.46,
      "end": 77.46,
      "text": "Old rooms wandered into orbit, landscapes grew out of a dream."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.96,
      "end": 87.46,
      "text": "I stood there with my hands on steady, not replaced and not alone."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.96,
      "end": 97.46,
      "text": "Watching color learn a language from the longing I had shown."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.46,
      "end": 106.46,
      "text": "I held the lamp, it changed the bloom."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.46,
      "end": 116.46,
      "text": "Undercame was stranger edges beauty moved beyond my reach."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.46,
      "end": 128.46,
      "text": "I opened my breath and I showed me what my younger hands could only carry as a spark."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.46,
      "end": 133.46,
      "text": "I will keep the light human, I will keep the question moving."
    },
    {
